<?php if($tab==='overview'):?>
<div class="lc-grid"><div class="lc-card"><span>Pending return approvals</span><strong><?=number_format($pendingReturns)?></strong></div><div class="lc-card"><span>Open cashier shifts</span><strong><?=number_format($openShifts)?></strong></div><div class="lc-card"><span>Stock counts in progress</span><strong><?=number_format($pendingCounts)?></strong></div></div>
<div class="lc-panel"><h2>Launch controls</h2><p>Use the tabs above to process returns, reconcile cashier floats, count physical stock and review system activity. Each workflow keeps a separate record and posts stock changes through the existing stock movement ledger.</p><p class="muted">eTIMS documents can be queued for integration preparation. This screen does not transmit invoices to KRA; live submission requires approved integration credentials, configuration and end-to-end testing.</p></div>
